      "term": "Term 1",
      "summary": "Use contextual evidence to study Hmong textile traditions respectfully, trace documented resources and processes, and make design-influence decisions without copying culturally significant motifs.",
      "next_action": "Apply the evidence, process-chain and respect checks to a source set before completing the section responses.",
